  "statements": [
    {
      "notes": "Contains: Fish (anchovy, sardine, tuna) and Soy.",
      "type": "Precautions re: Allergies"
    },
    {
      "notes": "Daily Values for Pregnant and Lactating Women. Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet. Ingredient list includes active nutrient sources; it must not be interpreted as an all-inactive list. Less than 2% of ingredients from Beta-Carotene through Zinc Oxide.",
      "type": "Other"
    },
    {
      "notes": "Adults, take one softgel and one tablet daily with food.",
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions"
    },
    {
      "notes": "Accidental overdose of iron-containing products is a leading cause of fatal poisoning in children under 6. Keep this product out of reach of children. In case of accidental overdose, call a doctor or poison control center immediately.",
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other"
    },
    {
      "notes": "SEE LEFT SIDE PANEL FOR ADDITIONAL WARNINGS",
      "type": "Other"
    },
    {
      "notes": "DO NOT EXCEED RECOMMENDED INTAKE. KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN CHILD RESISTANT CAP. IF PREGNANT, BREAST-FEEDING, TAKING MEDICATION, OR HAVE ANY MEDICAL CONDITION ASK A HEALTH PROFESSIONAL BEFORE USE. DUE TO THE USE OF COLORS DERIVED FROM NATURAL SOURCES, SOME DARK SPOTS MAY APPEAR ON THE SOFTGEL OVER TIME. THIS DOES NOT IMPACT PRODUCT QUALITY OR SAFETY. FOR ADULT USE ONLY, NOT FOR CHILDREN. DO NOT USE IF PRINTED SAFETY SEAL BEARING BAYER HEALTHCARE UNDER CAP IS TORN OR MISSING.",
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other"
    },
    {
      "notes": "Tablet Ingredients: Choline Bitartrate, Dicalcium Phosphate, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Food Starch-Modified, Acacia; Less than 2% of: Carnauba Wax, Hydroxypropyl Methylcellulose, Inulin, Magnesium Stearate, Medium Chain Triglycerides.",
      "type": "Other"
    },
    {
      "notes": "Key nutrients to support healthy fetal growth and development, with 4 brain-building ingredients.*",
